{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1546505-what-s-um-happening-here","id":1546505,"title":"What's...um, happening here?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-11-30T19:17:41-08:00","id":1546505,"title":"What's...um, happening here?","content":"Back in the day, this joint was jumping! Now, days go by with no messages at all, and only a handful of posters seem to be contributing at all? I'm getting flashbacks to the dwindling activity on the Usenet Newsgroups...As much as I hate to shoot the elephant in the room...Does this lack of activity mean that WW is in trouble? Have that many fans really left, either the company or the hobby as a whole? Or have most just moved on to a new forum or type on online interaction?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-30T20:48:10-08:00","id":1546512,"title":"","content":"There's still a fair amount of White Wolf posting in other corners of the internet. The issue is that Onyx Path is no longer really publishing a lot of White Wolf material (or at least World of Darkness material) so there's less and less to discuss. Many people who are newer to the WoD would have no idea what Onyx Path is and would likely view this as some weird, tertiary third party site. You also had a major loss of posters back when the Exalted board was down for almost a year. Very few of them ever came back, and people interested in discussing Exalted do so elsewhere. There's also just the simple fact that web forums like this are mostly filled with older posters. Younger people interested in RPGs or White Wolf in particular tend to congregate on social media like reddit, or twitter or (now) bluesky. So as older posters leave web forums like this one for a variety of reasons, there aren't many new posters to replace them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 12-01-2024, 12:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-30T22:04:33-08:00","id":1546515,"title":"","content":"There's also a lot of movement to the Onyx Path Discord or game specific servers. While Discord has worked on things like Threads to help make it a more useful platform for slower long form conversations, it's still much easier for conversations to speed by while you're busy with the rest of your life. But people tend to go to where the activity is.<br /> <br /> This specific forum also almost got taken off-line because the old version of its software was buggy to the point of certain areas of the forum being unusable (esp. the Exalted section). A new fan run Exalted forum was started because of that alone. While obviously the problems have been fixed, it lead to a pretty significant drop in activity during the era of a dysfunctional forum and then a bunch of issues adjusting to the new updates. It didn't help that a lot of this happened during the COVID pandemic, so a lot of people were online more, and this forum seemed to be dying.<br /> <br /> Paradox, the owners of the World of Darkness, the Chronicles of Darkness, and Exalted also aren't really helping much. The WoD 5th edition has been contentious and Onyx Path hasn't been hired to work on it in years; so there's less and less new topics to discuss and people trying to avoid repeated the same flame wars. Paradox has effectively ended the WoD 20th edition books despite a lot of material that never got addressed, and the entire Chronicles of Darkness, so again, there's very little new content to drive conversations.<br /> <br /> So, yeah, while we appreciate that Rich and company still value having a traditional forum, new platforms, coupled with a lot of factors beyond anyone here's control have drastically reduced it from what it used to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\u2615","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-02T17:33:05-08:00","id":1546546,"title":"","content":"These forums will have peaks and valleys when it comes to posting as we all have various interests and gaming sites we are on. Not to mention Christmas is around the corner and we are getting ready for that day. Myself I've been working alot of additional shifts because of Black Friday and Christmas and that cuts into the free time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-04T12:14:00-08:00","id":1546598,"title":"","content":"Huh, didn't know the Exalted forum had a &quot;White Out&quot; event! That must have been maddening...<br /> <br /> So, where exactly are these other places? Don't worry, I don't plan to completely bail on my old stomping grounds, but I would like to check out where the popular spots are these days...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-05T11:15:30-08:00","id":1546655,"title":"","content":"Sword of Creation is the Exalted forum I mentioned, which is still active along with this one and has a lot of overlap in users.<br /> <br /> The link to the Onyx Path Discord in on the home page of this website, and IIRC it's not hard to find things like the Exalted Discord, etc. from there (Discord isn't great for this and I don't think anyone's done a Linktree for all this).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-07T05:31:53-08:00","id":1546721,"title":"","content":"I'm still hanging around here (I try to check in every few days if I can), and this forum stil